{"code":"048470","name":"대동스틸","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1973년 법인 설립 후 철강재 유통업을 시작하고, 1975년 POSCO 열연제품 지정판매점으로 선정되어 성장해왔음. 1989년 포항공장에 Die Shear Line 설치로 Coil Service Center로 전환하였고, 2002년 코스닥 시장에 상장하였음. 현재 포항과 인천에 5기의 Coil Service 설비 가동 중이며, 포항공장은 물류비 최소화로 경쟁력을 확보하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2745.0,"open":2635.0,"high":2900.0,"low":2610.0,"volume":66942,"amount":183755790.0,"ret_1d":3.3898,"gap":-0.7533,"range_pct":10.5647,"ret_5":4.771,"ret_20":-4.5217,"ret_60":9.1451,"ret_120":-21.3467,"ret_250":-19.1458,"ma20":2783.0,"ma60":2722.3333,"ma120":2861.5833,"ma200":2994.425,"close_vs_ma200":-8.3296,"close_vs_ma60":0.8326,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":64.7216,"r2_60":0.3176,"slope_120":-35.4906,"r2_120":0.3049,"slope_250":-14.1916,"r2_250":0.178,"high52":4520.0,"low52":2275.0,"pos_52w":20.9354,"dd_52w":-39.2699,"mdd_1y":-42.25,"atr14_pct":8.1056,"vol_ann_60":45.2397,"vol_avg20":85993.2,"vol_ratio20":0.7785,"vr5":4.9274,"vr20":0.4647,"amount_avg5":521886382.0,"amount_avg20":234569454.0,"amount_avg60":146576758.8333,"obv_chg20":35.3569,"turnover_20":17.8224,"pv_eff_20":-0.2537,"rsi14":49.369,"frgn_net_5":14239.0,"inst_net_5":-731.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1476,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0076,"smart_net_5_pct":0.14,"frgn_net_20":-12332.0,"inst_net_20":67.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1278,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0007,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1271,"frgn_net_60":24974.0,"inst_net_60":5806.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.2588,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0602,"smart_net_60_pct":0.319,"frgn_net_120":-96055.0,"inst_net_120":5823.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.9954,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0603,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.935,"foreign_ratio":2.91,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.24,"smart_buy_streak":3,"op_income_q":21.0,"op_margin_q":6.7524,"op_qoq":2000.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":1150.0,"rev_yoy":5.0676,"op_trend_4q":110.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.26,"debt_ratio":31.21,"per":8.77,"pbr":0.35,"div_y